## Verification Plan
### Automated Verification
- Verify the MongoDB collections reflect the new schemas on the first run.
- Verify `text_search_ids` payload constructs correctly with `regionCode`.

### Manual Verification
- Test creating a search through the UI to ensure the 2-step preview flow works correctly and custom keywords are passed correctly.
- Test downloading an export with only a subset of columns selected.
- Manually trigger a mock quota limit hit to verify the UI warnings and `skipped_quota_blocked` logic.
